WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.670
Some ideas are too odd to schedule, and too interesting to delete. Give them a little garden.

2
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:11.910
Compost Club is a quiet home for unfinished thoughts. Drop in a few scraps, and let them mingle.

3
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:19.350
A forgotten postcard. A little library that lends the weather. Together, they could become something neither was alone.

4
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:26.130
Local Gemma blends the two into a new idea: walking routes that appear through borrowed fog and rain.

5
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.070
Every sprout keeps its roots. Open them to see the two thoughts that helped it grow.

6
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.140
Keep what makes you curious. Your favourite discoveries stay here, ready to revisit.

7
00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.220
Or take a little inspiration with you, with the thoughts that started it.

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:46.930
There is no rush to finish everything. Come back when you feel like exploring, and give another idea some room.

9
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:53.220
Your ideas, on your device. A little messy. A little magical. Let your wild ideas ferment.
